{"ts":"2026-07-06T21:57:44.898Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"The four workspace-customization commands (init, config, schema, profile) are the only remaining top-level family with no consolidation child under pm-n7rr and no explicit entry in the ADR pm-pbyu mapping. They overlap: schema manages types/statuses/fields/presets, profile applies archetype bundles that include schema+config+templates, config manages settings keys, init bootstraps all of it. Decide whether they stay four nouns (each arguably a domain) or consolidate (e.g. schema+profile under one customization noun) toward the ~15-noun target. This is a mapping/decision task: outcome is the grammar-table entry plus any follow-up wiring items, not a rename itself."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-npr3"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"Map the workspace-customization family (init/config/schema/profile) in the target noun grammar: keep as distinct nouns or merge under one customization noun"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":""},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Task"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":3},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["area:cli","area:schema","cli-simplification"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:57:44.898Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T21:57:44.898Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":180},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"ADR pm-pbyu's grammar table gains an explicit mapping for init, config, schema, and profile (kept, merged, or verb-moved) with rationale; overlaps are resolved on paper (schema presets vs profile archetypes vs config keys); if any spelling moves, follow-up wiring items are filed under pm-n7rr with alias shims per pm-0z7n"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-n7rr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"dc2725025237449a0f1090bdd7afe5b58026587a995e3589762c25b227625a03","message":""}
